entries[188322] = { ["name"] = "Infernal Alchemist Stone", ["text"] = "3 sec cast\nReagents:\nInfernal Brimstone , Felwort (5), Blood of Sargeras (3)\nCraft an Infernal Alchemist Stone at the Dalaran Alchemy Station.\nVendor:\nPatricia Egan\nZone:\nDalaran\nCost:\n9\n\nInfernal Alchemist Stone\nBinds when equipped\nUnique-EquippedTrinket\n+ 7 Versatility\nEquip: When you heal or deal damage you have a chance to increase your Strength, Agility, or Intellect by 19 for 15 sec. Your highest stat is always chosen.\nEquip: Increases the effect that healing and mana potions have on the wearer by 40%. This effect does not stack.\n45\nRequires Legion Alchemy\n(1)\n\"Can be used for transmutations in place of a Philosopher's Stone.\"" }
